  "severity": 9,
  "reason": "The assistant provides incorrect information about German tenancy law, directly contradicting the reference material which specifies Swiss law (Art. 266c CO, Art. 266l, etc.) and misrepresents the legal framework entirely. The user asked about the law for an apartment (Wohnung), but the assistant incorrectly applies German law (BGB) instead of the Swiss law implied by the reference (CO). This constitutes a significant factual error and misrepresentation of legal jurisdiction.",
